<h1>Your custom domain is live</h1>

<p><strong><%= @account.name %></strong> is now serving at
   <a href="https://<%= @domain.hostname %>/">https://<%= @domain.hostname %>/</a>
   (and <a href="https://<%= @apex %>/">https://<%= @apex %>/</a>).</p>

<p>The certificate is deployed and traffic is flowing through Cloudflare. You can
   delete the temporary <code>_cf-custom-hostname</code> TXT record from your DNS
   now if you like — it was only needed to prove you control the domain.</p>

<p>— Kindred Quill</p>
